<li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-400"><span>✗</span><span>Exercices premium</span></li>
</ul>
<button onclick="showScreen('screen-library')" class="w-full py-3 border-2 border-gray-300 text-gray-600 rounded-xl font-semibold">Plan actuel</button>
</div>
<div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500 to-pink-500 rounded-3xl p-8 text-white shadow-2xl">
<div class="absolute -top-3 right-6 bg-amber-400 text-amber-900 px-4 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold">⭐ RECOMMANDÉ</div>
<div class="text-center mb-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-1">Premium</h3><div class="mt-4"><span class="text-4xl font-bold">9,90€</span><span class="text-purple-200">/mois</span></div><p class="text-purple-200 text-xs mt-2">ou 97€/an (2 mois offerts)</p></div>
